1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,300
Ek din mein kitne moods? Subah se raat tak. Same you, new feeling.

2
00:00:03,100 --> 00:00:06,500
Khushi ka scene hai? Playlist bhi feel-good honi chahiye.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,450
Kabhi words nahi milte. Bas ek song samajh leta hai.

4
00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:12,400
Deadline ho ya deep work. Distractions ko mute karo.

5
00:00:12,150 --> 00:00:15,350
Friends. Bass. No plans to go home.

6
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:18,200
Kabhi-kabhi bas slow down. Aur apni space mein raho.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,200
Window seat ho ya long drive. Playlist makes the journey.

8
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,900
Har mood ka apna soundtrack. Your day. Your mood. Your music.

9
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:30,000
Jo feel karo. Play karo. Spotify. Har mood mein saath. Get it from Ning Store.
